suy ra $\widehat{ADB}= 180^{\circ}-\widehat{BAD}-\widehat{B}= 180^{\circ}-\left( 90^{\circ} -\dfrac{1}{2}\widehat{B}-\dfrac{1}{2}\widehat{C} \right)-\widehat{B}= 90^{\circ} -\dfrac{1}{2} (\widehat{B}-\widehat{C})=20^{\circ}$
}\end{ex}

